Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:43.16,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So if someone passes the ball in this direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:46.75,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs90\frx40\frz-15\c&H373637&\pos(1216,836)}Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:46.75,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs60\frx55\frz5\c&H373637&\pos(998,390)}Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:44.87,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,...you need to move like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:52.00,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This is important. The other team\N will try to get in the way, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.67,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,When that happens, don't panic. Just pass it behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:59.09,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,How do I put it... It's good to imagine the flow of the game in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:01.93,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,They're really getting into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:04.72,Default,Ekko,0000,0000,0000,,The festival is coming up, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.06,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.65,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Try to like, drop your hips a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:23.74,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,And pretend you're gouging out\N the ball with the inside of your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:25.70,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Then, you kick! Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:26.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:27.96,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,"Gouge out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:31.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.96,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kick! Kick! Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.21,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:30.79,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Then, one more-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.92,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:38.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:39.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,We're friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:40.84,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.02,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:51.10,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You really seem to dislike her, don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.02,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.73,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:58.78,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get me wrong, it's great that Sadako is making other friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:01.57,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Friends, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:05.74,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:03.41,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:05.74,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:09.33,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It'd piss me off if she became friendlier with her than us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.08,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:11.87,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute, Chizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:18.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I made a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:25.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, it doesn't feel very real\N since I didn't particularly work for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:31.35,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.94,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...friends now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:43.45,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe that's how people usually make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:52.96,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it feels unreal, it doesn't\N change the fact I'm really happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ku-ro-nu-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why did Kazehaya-kun just pop up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He has nothing to do with what I was thinking of!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I can't sleep!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:24.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I'm really blessed now that\N Kurumi-chan is willing to become friends with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,some things aren't going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:40.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,T-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.34,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.60,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What's with those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.10,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.52,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,They're nervous around each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:06.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, I'm having a hard time talking to Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.20,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:19.84,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.09,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the printout from the committee meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:24.26,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,They told me to bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:24.80,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.93,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. Your CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.14,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Give me just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:31.35,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you actually remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.52,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:33.47,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.18,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.27,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.40,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everything seems so natural...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:49.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's cute, charming, {\i1}and{\i0\fscx30} {\r} friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's really different from other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.84,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.3\fnArial Black\fs65\c&H3F3D3F&\pos(1075,109)}FACULTY ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:08.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:13.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan doesn't stiffen up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everything she does... seems so natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could be like her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.02,Default-alt,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.06,Default-alt,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:29.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:32.45,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's my fault. Sorry for startling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:37.08,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I kept calling your name, but you didn't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:40.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be the one apologizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:42.46,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:48.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:51.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kurumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:54.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I used her first name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that was too bold of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:01.02,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time you called me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.19,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:04.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She didn't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.19,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:08.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let me give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:09.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is my job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:16.29,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Your "job"? You're such a funny girl, Sawako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:20.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could be more like her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:24.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya! Here's your printout!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Now lend me your CD!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.71,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:29.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:30.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.05,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Americans?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:34.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:38.31,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, is something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:39.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.81,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,If something is, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:44.31,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't mind telling me, I'll try my best to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No, nothing's really bothering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:52.53,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You can always ask me for advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:02.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My role model... if offering to give me advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.05,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on! I dare you to hit the ball this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.55,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Throw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:15.55,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're having a hard time talking to Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:20.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I guess it's a lot different from talking to other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.06,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're thinking too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:31.28,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Since I've known Kazehaya really well since middle school, I'd say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:31.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:36.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever someone can't blend in with the rest of the class, he can't leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:40.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,And he talks with anyone, and I mean\N {\i1}anyone{\i0} as though they're really close...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:44.08,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he's talking to you, I'm sure he'll treat you like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:45.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:47.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I know exactly what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:52.80,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You know... it doesn't make you\N special just because he talks to you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:56.09,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't think you need to stiffen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:06.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... but you two are really, really different kinds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:13.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,With that in mind, maybe it'll be easier to talk with other guys who have a similar personality to yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:17.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,rather than someone as cheerful as Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:23.58,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has their own match, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:35.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why it appears so natural to see the two of you talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.51,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe so!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:42.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya and I have a lot in common, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:51.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun... uses her first name, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:55.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you two are really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.57,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:00.49,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,No way! We're just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really?! You two are just friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, so "just being friends" is more intimate than I'd imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I learned something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:18.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow... So if that's the way he interacts with his\N friends, maybe it's normal for me to be so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:21.47,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what do you say we head back now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:23.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.68,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:31.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't even greet him properly at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though that wasn't anything out of the ordinary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Kurumi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:55.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... feel much more optimistic after talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll change my motto to "one step at a time"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he makes me nervous, I'll just have to try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:05.76,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wai...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:14.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'll be able to become more like you if I work at it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No, no... I shouldn't fool myself. I know that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! Forget about what I just said!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.67,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi is, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:40.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,How do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.80,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This was back in middle school, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:44.26,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:47.56,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:51.60,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-chan really likes Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:56.15,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're good friends with him,\N do you think you could lend her a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:12:00.53,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It made me happy to have people count on me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:04.41,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What, you want me to somehow get you two alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:05.99,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,That's a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.54,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're reliable as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:14.12,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,That girl asked him out but got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.59,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was all fine up until then, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:20.96,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu-chan, could you take care of her, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.43,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu-chan, can you set {\i1}her{\i0\fscx30} {\r} up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.48,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too, Chizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:35.10,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu, don't forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:41.19,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... some girl wants to talk to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:43.65,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What's with all this lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.79,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! I'm not doing this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.58,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:55.50,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You helped Yumi out, but you won't help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.42,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,So you were on her side all along, Chizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.38,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,This is such a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:01.34,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Chizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.55,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Why won't you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:03.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.76,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not Chizu-chan's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:11.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's bad for all the girls in class to fight each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.48,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,If we can't all get along, it would be better...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:18.90,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...if none of you confessed your feelings for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.03,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I... couldn't care less...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:32.95,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:35.25,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya belongs to everyone, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:39.42,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I... really don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:48.68,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So basically, all the girls who were afraid of having Kazehaya stolen from them decided to join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.60,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.35,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:55.89,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a bad girl, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:58.69,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Helping each other out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:00.52,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,...is really a drag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.27,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We just don't really get along!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:03.07,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't want to have anything to do with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:06.49,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're really easy to manipulate, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.28,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:13.08,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,After hearing what you just said, I have a\N pretty good idea what that Kurumi girl is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:20.08,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Now... I wonder if things will go according to Kurumi-chan's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take a quick break!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.47,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.93,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to buy a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.55,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Could you get me some tea while you're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:33.76,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:43.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'll be able to become more like you if I work at it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think that was a little shameless of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:51.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.00,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:07.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kazehaya-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:14.68,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:18.68,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to say your name, but now\N I'm so nervous, I don't know what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:23.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Did Kazehaya-kun just say he was nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:28.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't really talked much lately, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.82,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck am I saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that I saw you on my way to the vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.79,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:44.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So I wasn't the only one feeling nervous...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.47,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:59.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He must have been thinking about the same things I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.23,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time since we met up at Ryu's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.03,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:17.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:17.87,Default-alt,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:24.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time I've seen you smile since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:28.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. Maru's gotten much bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:35.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:37.35,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'd say about this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:38.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:43.19,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,He really plays around a lot, so he makes a pretty big mess when he runs around inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:46.90,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I need to build him a doghouse soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Want to come see him next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:01.70,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:05.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,But he really hates being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:09.13,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if he'd agree to live in a doghouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:19.10,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.52,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumizawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:26.65,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,"-zawa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:31.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Her name is... Kurumizawa Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.90,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.78,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Her name is Kurumizawa Ume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:38.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumizawa... Ume?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:39.16,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:40.99,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Kurumizawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:42.66,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So your name is Kurumizawa Ume!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.63,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Kurumizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:56.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... so he wasn't referring to her by her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumizawa... Ume-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:02.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So her name is Ume-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:05.31,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:08.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I feel relieved for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:11.52,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,K-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.36,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.91,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I borrow Sawako-chan for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:23.16,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Well... sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:25.91,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,We need to have some girl talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Girl talk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:36.09,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Why is it that someone's always interrupting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:51.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what she meant by "girl talk"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where we're going, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... Kuru-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Ume-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.67,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:20.68,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...is fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay, Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it must be her nickname!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:30.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow... for a second there, I thought\N I made her mad by being overly familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:38.11,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is... there's someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.78,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I really want to go out with him,\N but I don't have the confidence to take action...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.03,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:48.45,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What she should do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.96,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's relying on me, and yet, I can't think of anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:04.43,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I want you to help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:07.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Help Kurumi-chan out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:12.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really? You think I can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.19,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a matter of whether you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:17.86,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I {\i1}want{\i0\fscx30} {\r} your help specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:23.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This... may be the first time anyone's relied on me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:26.03,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:27.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.70,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.91,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,B-But, what am I supposed to do exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.91,0:20:36.08,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you what to do, so don't worry too much about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:42.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But won't I kill the mood if I interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:45.72,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:48.10,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's someone you know really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:52.48,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:00.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,The person I like... is Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun?
